  "title": "Claude Voice Mode Gets Smarter: Opus, Sonnet, Your Email and Calendar, and More Languages (2026)",
  "summary": "On July 23, 2026, Anthropic upgraded Claude voice mode. It now runs on Claude's more capable Opus and Sonnet models, can reach connected tools like your email and calendar mid-conversation, and speaks many more languages. Here is what changed, how to use it, and where a chatbot voice ends and a real voice layer begins.",
